\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What is the AION 2 Armory & Profile Viewer?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"The AION 2 Armory and Profile Viewer on Shugo.GG lets you inspect any player's full character profile, equipment, gear stats, and item levels. Search for any character to view their complete profile and armory including weapons, armor, accessories, and enhancement levels.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How do I search for an AION 2 character?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Simply type the character name in the search bar on the homepage. You can search for any character profile across all servers and view their full armory with equipment, stats, rankings, and more.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Is Shugo.GG free to use?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes! Shugo.GG is 100% free. All features including character search, leaderboards, rift timers, item database, and news are available at no cost.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What servers does Shugo.GG support?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Shugo.GG supports AION 2 servers from Taiwan (TW) and Korea (KR) regions. You can switch between regions using the region selector.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What are rift timers?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Rift timers show you when the next rifts will open in AION 2. Never miss a rift event again with our real-time countdown timers displayed on every page.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What is the AION 2 class tier list?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"The AION 2 class tier list on Shugo.GG ranks all classes for PvP and PvE content using data-driven analysis from live leaderboard statistics. See which classes are performing best in arenas, battlegrounds, raids, and dungeons.\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n  </script>\n\n  <!-- Application Insights is initialized in React (see src/telemetry/appInsights.ts) -->\n\n  <!-- Legacy analytics.js removed: App Insights is the single telemetry pipeline. -->\n\n  \n  \n  <!-- Critical inline styles to prevent white flash -->\n  <style>\n    :root { --nav-height: 64px; --footer-height: 48px; }\n    @media (max-width: 768px) { :root { --nav-height: 54px; } }\n    @media (max-width: 480px) { :root { --nav-height: 50px; } }\n    html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #0d1117; color: #dce7ff; min-height: 100%; }\n    html { height: 100%; background: #0d1117; }\n    /* Font fallback to minimize CLS from web font loading */\n    body { font-family: 'Noto Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; font-synthesis: none; }\n    /* Viewport settings */\n    html, body { overflow: hidden !important; height: 100% !important; width: 100% !important; }\n    body.home-page { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n    \n    /* \n     * CLS Prevention Strategy:\n     * #root uses position:absolute to create a layer that doesn't affect document flow.\n     * When React renders content, it appears \"on top\" without shifting anything.\n     * This is the only way to prevent CLS in a client-side rendered SPA without SSR.\n     */\n    #root {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    \n    /* Main content layout */\n    .main-content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding-top: var(--nav-height); min-height: calc(100vh - var(--nav-height) - var(--footer-height)); overflow: hidden; }\n    /* Nav is fixed */\n    nav { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: var(--nav-height); z-index: 1000; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12, 16, 24, 0.98) 0%, rgba(12, 16, 24, 0.95) 100%); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 149, 0, 0.12); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); }\n    /* View containers */\n    #searchView { display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden; }\n    #dynamicView { display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden; }\n    #searchView.hidden, #dynamicView.hidden { display: none; }\n    /* Hero section */\n    #heroSection { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-start; padding: 16px 20px 96px; position: relative; min-height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden; }\n    #heroContent { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin-top: auto; margin-bottom: auto; }\n    /* Hide nav brand on home page */\n    .home-page .nav-brand { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }\n    /* Suppress transitions until app is ready */\n    html:not(.app-ready) * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }\n    /* Animations-disabled styles */\n    body.animations-disabled, body.animations-disabled *, body.animations-disabled *::before, body.animations-disabled *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }\n    body.animations-disabled .hero-bg-effects { display: none !important; }\n  </style>\n  \n  <!-- Apply animations-disabled class before CSS loads -->\n  <script nonce=\"i93EqFSexCD1KgT2PEomqQ\">\n    if (localStorage.getItem('shugo_animations_disabled') === 'true') {\n      document.documentElement.classList.add('animations-disabled');\n      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded